{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BVGFfaJOSe1795168026.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p><strong>極速狂奔Speed and Stunt</strong></p><p><br/>視帝張振朗聯同劉穎鏇（Tiffany）、朱敏瀚及周嘉洛，上演緊張刺激的高難度動作重頭戲「極速狂奔Speed and Stunt」，將全場氣氛推至另一高峰！<br/></p><p><p><img alt=\"2026T3bLfxA0451795096556.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xny6uGWAus1795167619.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"20264OjwCAs22m1795096582.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260EduEf19xv1795167614.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2026A7dg7dPsdj1795096621 (1).jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EvwdwRxgIr1795167608.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><br/>劉穎鏇親身上陣做出凌空鉸剪腳等高難度動作，動作自然流暢，盡顯打女本色！振朗型爆飛車，並挑戰多個驚險特技動作，令觀眾拍爛手掌！四人熱血沸騰的演出，亦是向一眾辛苦付出的幕後動作演員及特技人致敬。<br/></p><p><p><img alt=\"20260E0YzkLKyJ1795096452.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FxWBsSecGz1795167631.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2026e8q6nPcg361795096463.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026I9k5lERekC1795167625.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"DONG CHEUNG_1 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/2f42c559583847d9ba47c7c32f1dde87/snapshots/5933fc0326f54148a2c49afb9f7a9204-00006.jpg\"/></p></p><p><br/><br/>11月19日是《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》大喜日子，早前逾80藝員齊集6號幹線 (中九龍繞道—九龍灣段)，為台慶拍攝拍攝序幕，出席藝員有張振朗、劉穎鏇、周嘉洛、吳偉豪、朱敏瀚、陳曉華、馬貫東、劉佩玥、羅天宇、黃庭鋒等，一眾藝員有隧道口齊齊起舞，場面十分熱鬧。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_01.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264YoNbErzlO1794537828.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_02.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026I6qSHzFvtw1794537835.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_03.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KEPiZg5AiV1794537843.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_04.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265cJ3w3SZTc1794537851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_05.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EWhhaB9fcL1794537859.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.869876+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":12,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T09:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T20:17:33.844693+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:16.420396+00:00","content_hash":"995347b592539c76b335132d2c84a91150ab7d9f9f00b885e900a2f415189d9c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.869876+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}